pr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cabdeb545d1d23a0c778cc78ae744608 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2022446103850029056%2FVkk5xcVe.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5dbf4ed2eb765a756d8979163fdcfc36 3x"}, "body": "I would like to ask you to voice an original character of mine.\nHer name is Ode, she's a psychopathic witch.\nIf you need an image of her, please look at this :\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1eb4cgqR53LGyLb-xHAvjb-WWbFkaYNy3?usp=sharing\n______\n\n1: 「 プレゼントです。人間の心臓は珍味だと聞いたが、気に入るかもしれない。\n。。。私、いつも通り笑うしてるでしょ？\n\n。。。ねぇ、どうしてそんなに嫌われてるんだろう。どうして？\n私はただ、彼女に愛してほしかったーいや、好きになってほしかったんだ。彼女のためなら何でもできる 火の中を歩くこと、千の銃弾を受けること、恋人を救うこと、彼女を守ること、彼女のためなら何でもできる。\nそれにしても、なぜ彼女はこんなにも私を憎むのでしょうか？\nねえ、私ってそんなに目障りなの？」\n\n*I would like it if her voice is monotonous at the front, but gradually, her voice starts to break and her heart is broken as she weeps.\n\n2:「さあ、さあ、笑って喜ぼう。私は灰の中から戻ってきた。\n大切な友達、大切な場所、大切なあなた。帰ってきたよ! 」\n\n*Please have her sound excessively joyful, a bit psychopathic if it's possible..!\n_______\nI'm an English user, my Japanese is not very good, if there's any part that's strange, I would like to ask for your advise to alter it!\n\nThank you for your consideration..!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@midori_amane/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1485794, "client_id": 510051, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9373b316/uploads/origins/449bb3dc-cc39-48aa-8c28-174412a0c381?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=adadc6e61faea4a27c5c16d85d982362", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9373b316/uploads/origins/449bb3dc-cc39-48aa-8c28-174412a0c381?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=adadc6e61faea4a27c5c16d85d